  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 23 July 2025, the proposal as shown on the drawings submitted on 23 July 2025 and numbered 080/CAR/SO and 066/VIC/001A was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. \r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class E, Clauses E(a), E1(i) and E4 of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the proposed outbuilding includes primary living facilities and the use would not be incidental to the enjoyment of the dwellinghouse.\r\n"
